  "icon": "🏪",
  "description": "Welcome to Coast at The Beach Club Resort & Spa, where fine family dining meets relaxed Gulf-side charm and fresh coastal cuisine. Nestled along the glittering Gulf of Mexico, Coast Restaurant wraps every meal in breathtaking views and magical moments filled with world-class service and the finest local flavors. Let us welcome your family into our spacious dining room and upscale bar, or have a seat on the outdoor veranda to watch the waves roll over sugar-white sands. Savor the taste of fresh Gulf seafood and other family favorites from award-winning Chef John Hamme and his culinary team. Our Gulf-inspired dishes are made from locally-sourced ingredients and paired perfectly with handcrafted cocktails and curated wines, offering a mouthwatering experience that captures the best of Gulf Shores in every bite.",
